msgid "Professional Profile"
msgstr "Profiel"

msgid "QA Automation Engineer with 7+ years of experience in software quality assurance, including approximately 4 years focused on test automation. Experienced in medical, desktop, web and mobile applications, with a strong background in C#/.NET, Selenium, Playwright, Appium and WinAppDriver."
msgstr "QA Automation Engineer met meer dan 7 jaar ervaring in softwarekwaliteitsborging, waarvan ongeveer 4 jaar in testautomatisering. Ervaring met medische software en desktop-, web- en mobiele applicaties, en ruime kennis van C#/.NET, Selenium, Playwright, Appium en WinAppDriver."

msgid "Designs and maintains automation frameworks, performs API and integration testing, and integrates automated checks into CI/CD pipelines. Experienced in QA process improvement, technical investigation, mentoring and cross-functional collaboration."
msgstr "Ontwerpt en onderhoudt testautomatiseringsframeworks, voert API- en integratietests uit en integreert geautomatiseerde controles in CI/CD-pipelines. Ervaring met QA-procesverbetering, technisch onderzoek, begeleiding van collega’s en multidisciplinaire samenwerking."

msgid "Combines commercial QA experience in medical software with hands-on automation projects and AI-assisted software engineering, taking responsibility for reviewing, testing and validating delivered solutions."
msgstr "Combineert professionele QA-ervaring in medische software met praktijkgerichte automatiseringsprojecten en AI-ondersteunde softwareontwikkeling. Neemt verantwoordelijkheid voor het beoordelen, testen en valideren van opgeleverde oplossingen."

